## Summary format

When reviewing a {{ pr }}, start the summary with the number of problems found ("No problems found" if none), and end it with the risk tier on a line of its own:

`Risk: low|medium|high — <reason>`

low: docs only or no change in behavior; medium: a regular change; high: credentials and sign-in, CI and review configuration, possible data loss or privacy leaks, or a new architectural pattern others will copy.
